    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ héonon forð lǽte manna gehwylcne, ge earmne ge eadigne, folcrihtes weorðe ⁊ him man rihte domas deme.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And henceforth all men, both poor and rich, shall be regarded as entitled to the benefit of the law, and just decisions shall be pronounced on their behalf.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ heonon forð læte manna gehwylcne, ge earmne ge eadigne, folcrihtes weorðne, ⁊ him man rihte domas deme.</ab>
      </div>
